                    "text": "Rep. Strickland frames Medicaid cuts as a loss\u2014but ignores the systemic fraud and abuse draining the program. Washington\u2019s Medicaid system is collapsing under the weight of bureaucratic waste, eligibility loopholes, and non-citizen strain.\n\nThe Big Beautiful Bill (H.R. 1) redirects funds to Americans who paid into the system\u2014veterans, seniors, working families\u2014instead of subsidizing bloated admin costs and ER abuse.\n\nReal healthcare reform requires prioritizing citizens over D.C.\u2019s failed status quo.",
